{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo of \u300aThe Weird Dream\u300b,it contains Chapter One of the Game.Players will experience the storyline of the first chapter and at least 2 boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game is still in the development process, the quality of the trial version cannot represent the final game quality. Currently, in-game translation is completed by AI. If you encounter any problems, please forgive us. You can submit relevant issues to us through the player group or in-game links.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure in a delicately hand-painted fictional world. You will control the mysterious sickle maiden, explore this fantastic and colorful mysterious city - the &quot;Invisible City&quot;, find the truth of tomorrow's flower transformation, and save the alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufeff</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The capital without appearance:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A city shrouded in black mist all year round, with various areas divided within, only the elite class of society can travel to and from each area by &quot;train&quot;. Ordinary residents cannot have a complete understanding of the entire city. Therefore, the public named the city they live in as the &quot;Capital of No Appearance&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the black mist, each area of the city of no appearance has its own topography and cultural style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling and exhilarating series of battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waving the sickle symbolizing death in battle. Utilize a variety of attack derived actions and freely combine 15 different styles of skills to create refreshing combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/1.gif?t=1752825733\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/2025-02-0316-55-31-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752825733\" /></div>Exquisite hand drawn art style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many exquisite hand drawn backgrounds, animations, and comics in the game. Display the visual characteristics of this game through a large number of frame by frame and grid by grid drawings.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/3fc2f3c1b85a0b672f7ccc8e9783fb31.avif?t=1752825733\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exciting boss battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of exciting boss battles. Gorgeous skills to face monsters at different stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/2.gif?t=1752825733\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/2025-02-0316-58-25-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1752825733\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich Growth System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talent tree, skill upgrade, equipment system, pet system. Collecting materials and searching for treasures during the adventure constantly enhances players' abilities<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/3fc2f3c1b85a0b672f7ccc8e9783fb31.avif?t=1752825733\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826220/extras/e83de751f33632afdb0075582270306d.avif?t=1752825733\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"StarGod","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826220/c3ce2bf654eb2043d7afc84ec6d12341cdf0f3c9.jpg"},{"name":"Ice giant"